{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18509","headline":"薛舍人使君观察韩判官侍御许雨晴到所居既霁先呈即事 · 欧阳詹","name":"薛舍人使君观察韩判官侍御许雨晴到所居既霁先呈即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江臯昨夜雨收梅，寂寂衡门与钓台。\n西岛落花随水至，前山飞鸟出云来。\n观风驷马能言驻，行县双旌许蹔回。\n岂不偶然聊爲竹，空令石迳扫莓苔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}